        "summary": "In acetonitrile the cluster shows a DBM-centered π–π* absorption at 350 nm. In dichloromethane at room temperature, excitation at 350 nm gives Nd3+ NIR emission at 896, 1061, and 1332 nm; the 1061 nm lifetime is 8.29 μs and the lifetime-estimated quantum yield is 3.07%.",
